 **perfectly normal puzzle game** about connecting things together. It's perfect for normal people. Okay? Okay. Don't worry about it.\n\n\n# WHAT'S IN THE BOX?\n* 500+ puzzles by the multi-award-winning designer of Linelight\n* 60+ original mechanics\n* A memorable cast of very normal characters\n* Featuring music by the legendary Grant Kirkhope (Banjo-Kazooie, GoldenEye 007)\n* ...And much, much more!!!\n* Anti-climatic bullet points\n\n# PUZZLES, PUZZLES, PUZZLES\nBuild objects, solve 3D mazes, build coasters, bounce lasers, and much more. Scratch itches deep in your brain.\n{1223440118880908}\n\n# PLAY CUPID\nThis dog is a normal character with a normal storyline.\n{495296376732218}\n\n# SHADOW WORK\nPlay with size, rotation, and light. This part is pretty shady.\n{3925841577697925}\n\n# RUNNING JOKES\nWe apologize for nothing.\n{1747873889318890}\n\n# HANDS ON\nOptionally ditch those controllers and get fully immersed. Experience a white-glove service!\n{1057724902413239}", "short_description": "Snapstick is a perfectly normal puzzle game for perfectly normal people. It's filled with great puzzles, terrible jokes, and chock-full o' variety and surprises. Expect the unexpected.\n\nDO: Assemble roller coasters, match shadows to silhouettes, connect streets to unite dogs, bounce laser beams, and MANY more."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mydogzorro.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "My Dog Zorro", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.mydogzorro.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommend